        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage S251PD, Oval Handleset With Flair Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe oval shape of this handleset grants it a classic appearance that is very elegant. It is a double locking entrance plate, with a single cylinder deadbolt above a turn button operated latch. The two locks are interconnected, turning the inside lever retracts the deadbolt and latch simultaneously for immediate egress. Made for 1-3/8\" up to 2\" thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Locking Entrance Function</b> Deadbolt operated by key from the outside or by a turn unit on the inside; and the bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown. Outside lever unlocked by key from the outside when locked by turn button on the inside lever. Turning inside lever retracts deadbolt and latch simultaneously for immediate exit. Latch automatically deadlocks when door is closed.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage S251PD Double Locking Entrance Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UL rating for 3-hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant</li>\r\n<li>Panic Proof for emergency egress</li>\r\n<li>Metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>6-pin upper cylinder with 6-pin lower cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classical Oval Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to latch spacing:  4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt bore diameter:  1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever bore diameter:  2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" x 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Deadlatch: 1\" X 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-3/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Double Locking Entrance Plate, Schlage S251PD-FLA",
                "description": "Schlage S251PD-FLA Oval Entrance Lock With Flair Lever - The oval shape of this handleset grants it a classic appearance that is very elegant. It is a double locking entrance plate, with a single cylinder deadbolt above a turn button operated latch. The two locks are interconnected, turning the inside lever retracts the deadbolt and latch simultaneously for immediate egress. Made for 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches thick doors with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in 6 finishes.",
                "keywords": "SCH-S251PD-FLA, Schlage S251PD, Schlage S200 series, Schlage S251PD FLA, Sclage Flair Lever, Oval handlesets, commercial handlesets, double locking entrance plates, emergency egress"
